<title>USA: NICOR says Q3 up on general rate increase.</title>
<headline>NICOR says Q3 up on general rate increase.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NICOR Inc said higher third-quarter earnings and revenues came on a 2.8-percent general rate increase earlier this year at Northern Illinois Gas, the company's pricipal operating unit.</p>
<p>The gas utility also credited certain rate design changes that shift revenues and earnings to wam-weather months from cold-weather months.</p>
<p>The company on Wednesday posted quarterly earnings of $0.30 per share, up from $0.12 per share a year before. Revenues were $220.4 million, up from $157.1 million.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
